1
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:22,739
Got a newcomer here.

2
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:23,699
All of you, watch yourselves.

3
00:00:24,219 --> 00:00:25,559
He's in here with you now.

4
00:00:25,859 --> 00:00:26,800
Everyone stay in line.

5
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:27,879
Especially you,

6
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:29,199
Zhao.

7
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:31,539
Hurry up with that investigation.

8
00:00:32,039 --> 00:00:32,880
Look at this place.

9
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,159
This place doesn't suit me at all.

10
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:35,039
Step on it.

11
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:36,399
Zhang Haoran.

12
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:37,759
Who do you think you're talking to?

13
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:39,259
You think you can call me "Zhao"?

14
00:00:41,039 --> 00:00:41,579
Now stay put.

15
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:52,060
Haoran.

16
00:00:52,479 --> 00:00:53,840
Wait, what're you doing here?

17
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:54,899
A place like this...

18
00:00:55,399 --> 00:00:55,840
What about it?

19
00:00:55,979 --> 00:00:57,479
You can come here, but I can't?

20
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:58,320
No, I...

21
00:00:58,500 --> 00:00:59,259
What I mean is,

22
00:00:59,380 --> 00:01:00,039
with your status,

23
00:01:00,179 --> 00:01:01,359
why would you end up in a place like this?

24
00:01:02,359 --> 00:01:03,799
What's wrong with being here?

25
00:01:03,979 --> 00:01:05,659
Even locked up in here, I still make money.

26
00:01:06,140 --> 00:01:06,780
That's for damn sure.

27
00:01:07,159 --> 00:01:07,760
Let me tell you,

28
00:01:08,079 --> 00:01:10,500
Haoran is a real boss on the streets.

29
00:01:10,620 --> 00:01:12,159
He's a big shot, you know?

30
00:01:12,359 --> 00:01:12,879
When it comes to making money,

31
00:01:12,980 --> 00:01:14,620
we've gotta learn from Haoran.

32
00:01:15,140 --> 00:01:16,079
Come on, fill us in!

33
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:17,340
Yeah, tell us!

34
00:01:19,340 --> 00:01:19,760
Alright.

35
00:01:20,739 --> 00:01:22,079
Looking at you guys,

36
00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:23,540
have you just been bumming around on the streets?

37
00:01:23,980 --> 00:01:25,040
First, you tell me.

38
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,659
In this society right now,

39
00:01:27,540 --> 00:01:28,480
what's the real trend?

40
00:01:28,799 --> 00:01:29,879
What makes money the fastest?

41
00:01:30,299 --> 00:01:30,840
Well...

42
00:01:31,459 --> 00:01:32,159
Snatching military caps?

43
00:01:32,459 --> 00:01:33,719
Running lucky-draw scams at the station?

44
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:34,959
Can't you make money off all that?

45
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:36,280
With that brain of yours,

46
00:01:36,519 --> 00:01:37,980
all you ever think about is women's purses.

47
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:41,180
Look, if you've got time to do stints in jail,

48
00:01:41,319 --> 00:01:43,260
why can't you watch the TV news?

49
00:01:43,420 --> 00:01:44,739
Or at least listen to the radio?

50
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:46,099
Try learning something for a change.

51
00:01:46,359 --> 00:01:47,239
All you do is pack on fat.

52
00:01:47,319 --> 00:01:48,040
Look how chubby you've gotten!

53
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,340
Still stuffing your face, day in, day out!

54
00:01:50,180 --> 00:01:50,939
Let me tell you guys.

55
00:01:51,579 --> 00:01:52,500
What is the trend?

56
00:01:54,420 --> 00:01:55,140
Reform and opening up.

57
00:01:56,299 --> 00:01:57,359
Freeing your mind.

58
00:01:58,159 --> 00:01:59,260
Revitalizing the economy.

59
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:01,299
And what does revitalizing the economy mean?

60
00:02:01,459 --> 00:02:01,980
Do you have any idea?

61
00:02:03,079 --> 00:02:03,719
No idea.

62
00:02:04,459 --> 00:02:06,879
It means turning dead money into live cash.

63
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:08,860
In other words, you gotta make money circulate.

64
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:11,180
You take the money from the pockets of the useless,

65
00:02:11,479 --> 00:02:12,080
and you make it flow right into

66
00:02:12,259 --> 00:02:14,240
the pockets of capable folks with connections.

67
00:02:14,759 --> 00:02:16,120
Now that's what a real trend is.

68
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:16,860
You got that?

69
00:02:21,219 --> 00:02:21,960
Let me tell you.

70
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:22,900
I—

71
00:02:26,139 --> 00:02:26,939
You listening, Zhao?

72
00:02:28,139 --> 00:02:28,819
You should listen.

73
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:29,740
It'll do you good.

74
00:02:29,860 --> 00:02:30,680
It's how you make money.

75
00:02:30,979 --> 00:02:31,539
Learn a thing or two.

76
00:02:34,319 --> 00:02:34,939
I'm done listening.

77
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:36,740
Come back when you wanna hear more!

78
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,000
Boss,

79
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,759
this Zhang Haoran is definitely hiding something.

80
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:44,500
Look, we ask him ten questions,

81
00:02:44,620 --> 00:02:45,680
and he won't answer a single one.

82
00:02:46,199 --> 00:02:47,639
He's just talking in circles and dodging us.

83
00:02:47,819 --> 00:02:49,120
I swear, I really feel like...

84
00:02:49,180 --> 00:02:49,939
Feel like what?

85
00:02:50,460 --> 00:02:52,060
I feel like kicking my own ass!

86
00:02:52,099 --> 00:02:52,460
That's enough.

87
00:02:53,020 --> 00:02:54,120
Does throwing a fit solve anything?

88
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:55,819
You think he's dirty.

89
00:02:55,979 --> 00:02:56,960
I think he's dirty too.

90
00:02:57,479 --> 00:02:59,360
Even Old Man Wang at the gate thinks he's dirty.

91
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:00,319
Where's the evidence?

92
00:03:00,860 --> 00:03:01,639
We've interrogated him all night.

93
00:03:02,340 --> 00:03:03,460
Where's the hard evidence to nail him down?

94
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:04,539
Zhao.

95
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,780
Cracking cases isn't like *Tracks in the Snowy Forest*.

96
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:08,460
It's not like the bad guys

97
00:03:09,060 --> 00:03:09,800
have it stamped on their foreheads.

98
00:03:11,300 --> 00:03:11,939
My water...

99
00:03:14,599 --> 00:03:15,280
Just cooling it down for you.

100
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:19,080
That's not very hygienic.

101
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,520
But he clearly knows...

102
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,900
...about the stolen tractor factory engines.

103
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:22,960
He's definitely up to his neck in it.

104
00:03:23,219 --> 00:03:24,580
Plus how he corrupted Director Ma—

105
00:03:25,060 --> 00:03:25,919
isn't that obvious?

106
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:27,340
Are we just gonna sit back and do nothing?

107
00:03:27,539 --> 00:03:29,199
You think I've gone senile?

108
00:03:29,379 --> 00:03:30,099
During the interrogation,

109
00:03:30,259 --> 00:03:32,219
I just fixated on his prostitution ring.

110
00:03:32,340 --> 00:03:33,580
Then what was your real target?

111
00:03:34,699 --> 00:03:36,919
Rattle the cage instead of startling the snake.

112
00:03:37,599 --> 00:03:39,080
We're in the open, and they're in the dark.

113
00:03:39,379 --> 00:03:40,580
He knows we're onto him,

114
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,419
but...

115
00:03:41,879 --> 00:03:43,400
he doesn't know how far we've gotten,

116
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,139
or how many cards we're holding.

117
00:03:45,860 --> 00:03:47,000
I want him to think

118
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,500
our flashlight

119
00:03:49,180 --> 00:03:50,060
is pointing in the wrong direction.

120
00:03:51,379 --> 00:03:52,020
Chew on that for a bit.

121
00:03:52,879 --> 00:03:53,319
Shine.

122
00:03:54,099 --> 00:03:55,000
Right, I'll shine it on him.

123
00:03:55,419 --> 00:03:56,020
I'll keep it right on him.

124
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:56,960
I'll shine it till he breaks!

125
00:03:57,139 --> 00:03:58,159
Then I'll bust him!

126
00:03:58,219 --> 00:03:59,360
And then every single one of those bastards...

127
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,379
I'll round them all up in one sweep!

128
00:04:00,659 --> 00:04:01,259
Where are you going?

129
00:04:01,979 --> 00:04:03,659
I'm gonna comb through his statement again.

130
00:04:03,759 --> 00:04:04,800
See if his endless rambling

131
00:04:04,979 --> 00:04:05,919
let anything slip.

132
00:04:07,979 --> 00:04:08,539
Sorry about that.

133
00:04:08,819 --> 00:04:09,280
Excuse me.

134
00:04:10,020 --> 00:04:11,060
If you need anything, find Zhao.

135
00:04:11,379 --> 00:04:12,080
I'm off, boss.

136
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:12,840
Go on.

137
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:16,120
Where's the tea?

138
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:20,060
Crossing paths with you guys today must be fate.

139
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,220
Let me teach you a thing or two.

140
00:04:21,819 --> 00:04:23,800
Let's talk about what a market economy is,

141
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:26,019
and what optimizing resource allocation means.

142
00:04:27,379 --> 00:04:28,720
Though telling a bunch of knuckleheads like you,

143
00:04:28,839 --> 00:04:30,040
you probably won't get it anyway.

144
00:04:30,439 --> 00:04:32,639
Like an old sow listening to the radio.

145
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:35,180
Ask her later, she just grunts and remembers nothing.

146
00:04:35,420 --> 00:04:35,899
Right?

147
00:04:37,259 --> 00:04:37,920
Let me tell you.

148
00:04:38,300 --> 00:04:39,759
If a guy wants to make good money,

149
00:04:40,220 --> 00:04:41,079
part of it is luck,

150
00:04:41,860 --> 00:04:42,740
but more importantly,

151
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,000
you gotta use your head.

152
00:04:47,399 --> 00:04:48,860
I set up a little dark room,

153
00:04:49,839 --> 00:04:51,699
and hung a heavy black curtain inside.

154
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,279
Looking in from the outside,

155
00:04:53,519 --> 00:04:54,540
you can't see a damn thing.

156
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,579
Without turning on the lights inside,

157
00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:56,579
you still can't see squat.

158
00:04:57,459 --> 00:04:58,800
Then on the kang bed inside,

159
00:05:00,019 --> 00:05:01,939
I put two stark-naked broads.

160
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:04,819
And I sit at the door charging admission.

161
00:05:05,339 --> 00:05:05,839
Step inside?

162
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:07,100
Two yuan.

163
00:05:07,740 --> 00:05:09,019
Once inside, you can't see anything, right?

164
00:05:09,339 --> 00:05:10,319
So I bring out a flashlight for you.

165
00:05:10,959 --> 00:05:11,459
Light on the face?

166
00:05:12,060 --> 00:05:12,620
Three yuan.

167
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:13,939
Lower down?

168
00:05:14,339 --> 00:05:14,839
Five yuan.

169
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,120
Even lower?

170
00:05:16,420 --> 00:05:16,920
Ten yuan.

171
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:17,920
How's that?

172
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,439
Haoran, how does that brain of yours work?

173
00:05:19,519 --> 00:05:20,660
That's pure genius!

174
00:05:21,100 --> 00:05:22,100
Haoran, I just wanna know...

175
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:23,439
What if I give you 50?

176
00:05:23,620 --> 00:05:24,240
What happens then?

177
00:05:24,540 --> 00:05:25,800
Why are you so damn horny?

178
00:05:26,019 --> 00:05:26,579
You pay 50,

179
00:05:26,620 --> 00:05:27,920
I'll pull the light cord for you,

180
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:28,839
and you can do whatever the hell you want!

181
00:05:31,540 --> 00:05:32,240
Quick, hurry up.

182
00:05:32,420 --> 00:05:33,000
Sit down, sit!

183
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,240
Come on, come on.

184
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:35,759
Massage my shoulders.

185
00:05:38,199 --> 00:05:38,819
You guys...

186
00:05:39,180 --> 00:05:40,160
first need to figure out

187
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,920
what a market economy is.

188
00:05:42,579 --> 00:05:43,699
Once you wrap your head around that,

189
00:05:43,899 --> 00:05:44,920
then I'll teach you guys

190
00:05:45,439 --> 00:05:47,019
how to grasp the pulse of the era.

191
00:05:48,839 --> 00:05:49,439
Stop, stop rubbing.

192
00:05:49,579 --> 00:05:50,540
A guy rubbing me creeps me out.

193
00:05:50,699 --> 00:05:51,480
Give me a break...

194
00:05:52,060 --> 00:05:52,620
Wait, man.

195
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:53,560
What... what...

196
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:54,800
did you get thrown in here for?

197
00:05:55,579 --> 00:05:56,639
Those country bumpkins

198
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,459
just had to bust my spot.

199
00:05:59,100 --> 00:06:00,759
I mean, I was done with that joint anyway.

200
00:06:00,959 --> 00:06:01,639
Why even bother busting it?

201
00:06:02,279 --> 00:06:03,199
'Cause that crap doesn't make real money.

202
00:06:04,100 --> 00:06:04,879
How do you make real money?

203
00:06:06,100 --> 00:06:08,339
To make real money, you gotta hustle the big stuff.

204
00:06:08,860 --> 00:06:10,339
That's where the massive profits are.

205
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,860
What counts as big stuff?

206
00:06:13,660 --> 00:06:14,560
What's the big stuff?

207
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:15,959
What is it?

208
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,740
Think I'd tell you?

209
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:18,720
Not a chance.

210
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,160
Come on, don't tease us.

211
00:06:20,699 --> 00:06:22,120
Take the boys with you when you get out.

212
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:22,860
We wanna roll with you.

213
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,139
Take you with me?

214
00:06:24,300 --> 00:06:24,800
Take us along!

215
00:06:24,980 --> 00:06:25,379
Yeah!

216
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:26,860
What can you guys even do?

217
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:28,959
Zhang Haoran doesn't keep freeloaders around.

218
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,279
Plenty of folks wanna roll with me.

219
00:06:31,899 --> 00:06:32,379
Let me tell you,

220
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:33,220
in this slammer...

221
00:06:36,639 --> 00:06:37,379
Besides me,

222
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,740
there's another real hotshot.

223
00:06:40,139 --> 00:06:40,899
This guy,

224
00:06:41,319 --> 00:06:43,139
known as Songliao's top master thief,

225
00:06:43,519 --> 00:06:45,160
loves to punish the wicked and uphold the good,

226
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,139
robbing the rich to help the poor.

227
00:06:47,300 --> 00:06:49,339
So now, with a warm round of applause,

228
00:06:49,519 --> 00:06:50,779
please welcome Erdongzi!

229
00:06:51,079 --> 00:06:51,680
Come on, put your hands together!

230
00:06:55,980 --> 00:06:56,959
What are you doing over there?

231
00:06:57,100 --> 00:06:57,920
Making all that racket?

232
00:06:59,279 --> 00:06:59,899
Just chatting.

233
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:01,060
Chatting? Keep it down.

234
00:07:01,220 --> 00:07:01,860
Settle down, all of you.

235
00:07:02,620 --> 00:07:03,480
All right, all right.

236
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:08,300
Erdongzi.

237
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:09,399
Quit hiding.

238
00:07:09,540 --> 00:07:10,860
I saw you the second I came in.

239
00:07:11,060 --> 00:07:11,699
Dodging me?

240
00:07:18,259 --> 00:07:18,819
Haoran,

241
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,220
don't listen to the rumors.

242
00:07:21,060 --> 00:07:23,600
I just pinch small stuff to get by.

243
00:07:24,399 --> 00:07:25,740
I'm not worthy of rolling with you.

244
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,000
Exactly, Haoran.

245
00:07:27,300 --> 00:07:28,100
What master thief?

246
00:07:28,500 --> 00:07:29,920
Would a master thief get locked up in here?

247
00:07:30,759 --> 00:07:32,259
He just got drunk and fought someone.

248
00:07:37,420 --> 00:07:38,139
Erdongzi.

249
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,660
Word on the street is you've got real skills.

250
00:07:41,100 --> 00:07:42,060
But I've never seen them myself.

251
00:07:42,939 --> 00:07:43,420
Tell you what.

252
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:44,680
Show me what you've got.

253
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:46,160
If you can pull it off,

254
00:07:46,540 --> 00:07:47,779
what I said before still stands.

255
00:07:48,379 --> 00:07:49,540
You roll with me when we get out,

256
00:07:50,319 --> 00:07:51,300
and you'll live like a king.

257
00:07:52,740 --> 00:07:53,939
You flatter me.

258
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,839
I'm strictly amateur.

259
00:07:57,519 --> 00:07:58,560
Don't waste your time on me.

260
00:08:01,220 --> 00:08:01,860
How about this, then?

261
00:08:02,579 --> 00:08:03,819
Everyone's here right now anyway.

262
00:08:04,079 --> 00:08:05,199
I'll make a bet with Erdongzi.

263
00:08:05,699 --> 00:08:06,620
During the Shakedown,

264
00:08:07,279 --> 00:08:08,819
if you can swipe the button off my collar,

265
00:08:09,420 --> 00:08:10,019
you win.

266
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,160
I'll even call you Dad.

267
00:08:11,620 --> 00:08:12,319
No, no, no way.

268
00:08:12,500 --> 00:08:13,160
Hold on, wait up.

269
00:08:13,459 --> 00:08:14,139
I'm not done talking.

270
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:16,620
If you fail to get it off,

271
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:18,680
or if I catch you red-handed,

272
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:25,160
then from now on, your hands...

273
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:26,420
will belong to me.

274
00:08:27,279 --> 00:08:28,180
Wherever I tell you to touch,

275
00:08:28,339 --> 00:08:29,199
you touch.

276
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:30,980
Whatever I tell you to steal,

277
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:32,179
you steal.

278
00:08:38,779 --> 00:08:39,419
Erdongzi.

279
00:08:40,460 --> 00:08:41,899
Those two guys you fought at the diner,

280
00:08:42,059 --> 00:08:43,179
who do you think they work for?

281
00:08:45,799 --> 00:08:47,059
If I could put you in here this time,

282
00:08:47,919 --> 00:08:49,220
I can make sure you keep coming back.

283
00:08:52,220 --> 00:08:52,980
Play your cards right.

284
00:08:53,419 --> 00:08:53,980
It's all up to you.

285
00:08:54,500 --> 00:08:55,039
Good luck.

286
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:56,799
Get up.

287
00:09:10,039 --> 00:09:11,720
You want Ziwen to go to the station

288
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,340
and say he did it,

289
00:09:13,820 --> 00:09:15,059
and that Zhuzi had nothing to do with it?

290
00:09:15,679 --> 00:09:16,120
Is that it?

291
00:09:25,820 --> 00:09:26,320
Tian,

292
00:09:27,559 --> 00:09:28,580
by all rights,

293
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:31,019
Zhuzi counts as half a brother to us.

294
00:09:31,659 --> 00:09:32,460
But then again,

295
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,700
he gets his apples and ribbonfish every day,

296
00:09:34,860 --> 00:09:35,779
and his heating coal.

297
00:09:35,940 --> 00:09:37,259
He made it clear he wouldn't join us.

298
00:09:37,860 --> 00:09:38,580
If you ask me,

299
00:09:38,820 --> 00:09:40,419
he's not worth it.

300
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,720
What kind of talk is that?

301
00:09:46,139 --> 00:09:46,860
Eastern Tyrant!

302
00:09:48,820 --> 00:09:50,019
You went to avenge your brother,

303
00:09:50,299 --> 00:09:51,500
so why is Zhuzi the one locked up?

304
00:09:52,860 --> 00:09:54,080
You're the one who beat the guy!

305
00:09:54,700 --> 00:09:55,820
You're the ones who caused this mess!

306
00:09:56,559 --> 00:09:57,259
Now Zhuzi's taking the fall,

307
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,639
taking the heat all alone inside!

308
00:09:59,279 --> 00:10:00,720
While you guys walk away scot-free!

309
00:10:02,500 --> 00:10:03,580
Aren't you all about brotherhood?

310
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:06,700
Why stab him in the back like this?

311
00:10:06,899 --> 00:10:07,799
Watch your mouth!

312
00:10:08,139 --> 00:10:09,299
You can eat whatever you want,

313
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:10,720
but don't go running your mouth!

314
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,259
Tian asked him to go.

315
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:14,039
If he didn't want to come, he didn't have to.

316
00:10:14,639 --> 00:10:16,440
Come on, you're playing him for a fool!

317
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:17,960
You knew he was simple,

318
00:10:18,100 --> 00:10:19,299
so you used him as a shield,

319
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:20,860
and tossed him aside when you were done!

320
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,740
You really got no filter on your mouth, do you?

321
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:24,379
Coming around here to start shit?

322
00:10:24,460 --> 00:10:25,360
Do you even know who we are?

323
00:10:25,539 --> 00:10:25,980
Shut up.

324
00:10:39,259 --> 00:10:39,899
Ziwen.

325
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,679
Zhuzi was taken in yesterday afternoon.

326
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,320
It's been all night,

327
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,179
and the police haven't come for us.

328
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:48,299
He must've taken the fall himself.

329
00:10:48,679 --> 00:10:49,379
He didn't rat us out.

330
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:55,340
The day before yesterday,

331
00:10:56,340 --> 00:10:57,480
he saved my brother Menglong.

332
00:10:58,620 --> 00:10:59,460
On the frozen river,

333
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,480
he took a knife for me from Li Laogunzi.

334
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:03,620
Today,

335
00:11:04,580 --> 00:11:05,639
he took the rap for me again.

336
00:11:08,279 --> 00:11:09,159
For a guy like me,

337
00:11:09,879 --> 00:11:11,299
there's only one rule for brothers:

338
00:11:11,899 --> 00:11:12,759
however he treats me,

339
00:11:13,399 --> 00:11:14,159
that's how I treat him.

340
00:11:17,100 --> 00:11:18,379
I'm definitely getting Zhuzi out.

341
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:20,379
Ziwen,

342
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:22,039
if you go try to get him out,

343
00:11:22,279 --> 00:11:24,299
aren't you putting yourself out in the open?

344
00:11:24,940 --> 00:11:26,559
If the police start digging into it

345
00:11:26,740 --> 00:11:28,120
and lock us all up, what do we do?

346
00:11:28,399 --> 00:11:29,100
What's there to be afraid of?

347
00:11:29,539 --> 00:11:30,120
For one thing,

348
00:11:30,620 --> 00:11:31,600
Li Laogunzi didn't die.

349
00:11:32,580 --> 00:11:33,200
For another,

350
00:11:34,059 --> 00:11:36,120
haven't we been in there plenty of times?

351
00:11:36,860 --> 00:11:37,659
We know the drill.

352
00:11:38,100 --> 00:11:38,620
What's to fear?

353
00:11:46,059 --> 00:11:47,059
Move! Stop pulling on me!

354
00:11:47,220 --> 00:11:48,220
I can walk! Want me to beat your ass?

355
00:11:48,820 --> 00:11:49,259
Tian,

356
00:11:49,419 --> 00:11:50,820
this kid was pacing outside for ages,

357
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:52,120
so I dragged him in.

358
00:11:56,340 --> 00:11:56,860
Tian,

359
00:11:57,460 --> 00:11:59,179
I'm Huang Zhonghua.

360
00:12:00,059 --> 00:12:01,879
"Zhonghua" as in the motherland.

361
00:12:04,139 --> 00:12:05,639
You've got some nerve, kid.

362
00:12:05,919 --> 00:12:07,240
Daring to come to our turf.

363
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:08,940
Pretty bold of you, huh?

364
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,679
Aren't you afraid of ending up dead on the ice?

365
00:12:12,179 --> 00:12:13,519
Tian, you're joking.

366
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:16,480
Nobody hits a smiling face.

367
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:20,039
That day on the frozen river, I saw it:

368
00:12:20,100 --> 00:12:21,659
you're definitely number one, Tian.

369
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:23,500
As the saying goes,

370
00:12:24,379 --> 00:12:27,360
your presence shakes the whole realm,

371
00:12:28,340 --> 00:12:30,720
your might rivals the Hegemon-King!

372
00:12:32,740 --> 00:12:33,980
While I, Huang Zhonghua,

373
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,240
may have other talents,

374
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,799
my greatest strength

375
00:12:36,879 --> 00:12:38,139
is reading the situation.

376
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,039
So here it is—

377
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,799
the heavens gave me a chance,

378
00:12:41,580 --> 00:12:42,620
and I came to pay respects.

379
00:12:43,259 --> 00:12:43,840
From now on,

380
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:46,879
I want to roll with you, Tian.

381
00:12:49,340 --> 00:12:50,279
What the hell were you thinking?

382
00:12:51,100 --> 00:12:52,480
A couple days ago, your boss almost got

383
00:12:52,559 --> 00:12:53,799
drowned in the river,

384
00:12:54,500 --> 00:12:56,100
and today you're looking for a new one?

385
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:57,279
Seems like your disloyal bones

386
00:12:57,419 --> 00:12:58,860
are poking right out of your head!

387
00:13:00,679 --> 00:13:02,299
Before I rip off one of your legs,

388
00:13:02,779 --> 00:13:03,559
get the hell out of here!

389
00:13:04,460 --> 00:13:05,039
Fair enough.

390
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:06,259
Fair enough.

391
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:08,419
But...

392
00:13:09,340 --> 00:13:09,840
Tian,

393
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:11,779
Li Laogunzi...

394
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:14,259
he came to town to scrape by with me.

395
00:13:14,460 --> 00:13:15,659
Who knew within two days of arriving,

396
00:13:15,799 --> 00:13:16,759
you'd beat him half to death?

397
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:17,320
And now... now...

398
00:13:17,879 --> 00:13:19,120
we can't even afford his medical bills.

399
00:13:19,980 --> 00:13:21,620
Here are the diagnosis and pharmacy receipts.

400
00:13:22,559 --> 00:13:23,919
Tian, could you have a heart

401
00:13:24,539 --> 00:13:25,379
and spare us a few extra bucks?

402
00:13:36,779 --> 00:13:37,480
Or else what?

403
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,779
You'll go tell the police,

404
00:13:40,879 --> 00:13:42,340
and rat all of us out?

405
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,100
Wh-What do you mean?

406
00:13:48,580 --> 00:13:50,279
You did this to Hai-Haizhu?

407
00:13:53,919 --> 00:13:54,960
You're the one who called the cops?

408
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:56,480
Street business is settled on the streets.

409
00:13:56,639 --> 00:13:57,440
Yang Wu.

410
00:14:00,940 --> 00:14:01,419
Tian.

411
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,240
I showed up here today,

412
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,019
but that money,

413
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:06,379
I'm taking it with me.

414
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:07,960
Otherwise,

415
00:14:08,460 --> 00:14:09,440
you boys can just

416
00:14:10,019 --> 00:14:11,080
throw me into the frozen river, too,

417
00:14:11,279 --> 00:14:12,080
and finish me off as well.

418
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:14,320
If I die, it doesn't matter.

419
00:14:14,580 --> 00:14:15,480
You're different, Tian.

420
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:16,639
You're the Eastern Tyrant.

421
00:14:17,740 --> 00:14:19,360
I didn't rat you out at the police station,

422
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:21,980
but my boys might not keep their mouths shut.

423
00:14:22,740 --> 00:14:24,539
If I'm not back there keeping them in line,

424
00:14:25,759 --> 00:14:26,620
who knows when

425
00:14:27,279 --> 00:14:29,379
all your shady dealings

426
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:30,600
will be spilled for everyone to hear.

427
00:14:40,419 --> 00:14:41,000
Baige.

428
00:14:42,179 --> 00:14:43,879
Zhou Meng's been terrified all day.

429
00:14:44,220 --> 00:14:45,159
Take her home first.

430
00:14:47,019 --> 00:14:48,100
What about Haizhu?

431
00:14:50,960 --> 00:14:51,820
Don't you trust me?

432
00:14:53,899 --> 00:14:54,360
All right.

433
00:14:57,159 --> 00:14:57,940
Name your price.

434
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:02,600
Li's medical and hospital bills,

435
00:15:03,019 --> 00:15:05,000
plus compensation for my boys,

436
00:15:05,159 --> 00:15:06,279
lost wages, and recovery fees.

437
00:15:07,419 --> 00:15:09,639
Give me this much.

438
00:15:10,139 --> 00:15:10,700
300.

439
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:11,799
How much?

440
00:15:12,279 --> 00:15:12,899
300.

441
00:15:13,220 --> 00:15:14,179
300?

442
00:15:15,559 --> 00:15:17,519
Everything on this bill adds up to 100 at most.

443
00:15:19,100 --> 00:15:19,980
Are you shaking us down?

444
00:15:26,860 --> 00:15:27,980
Take care of this in a bit.

445
00:15:31,139 --> 00:15:32,539
You're a stand-up guy, Tian.

446
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:33,320
Truly magnanimous!

447
00:15:33,919 --> 00:15:35,700
You're practically Songliao City's Timely Rain,

448
00:15:35,860 --> 00:15:36,799
a real Lord Mengchang!

449
00:15:37,519 --> 00:15:39,259
Even more generous than Lord Mengchang!

450
00:15:41,019 --> 00:15:41,840
Feeling better now?

451
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:50,860
Let's go. I'll walk you back.

452
00:16:07,019 --> 00:16:07,659
Boys.

453
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:08,820
Tian.

454
00:16:09,500 --> 00:16:10,759
You guys wait here.

455
00:16:11,100 --> 00:16:13,080
I'll take care of our brother's business.

456
00:16:14,639 --> 00:16:16,700
You haven't eaten yet, have you?

457
00:16:17,539 --> 00:16:18,440
Why not grab a bite here?

458
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:19,460
Sit.

459
00:16:21,419 --> 00:16:21,860
Tian...

460
00:16:22,019 --> 00:16:23,639
So you... you're taking me in?

461
00:16:24,940 --> 00:16:25,600
That's great!

462
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:26,759
Tian...

463
00:16:26,940 --> 00:16:28,159
Then... let me have a drink with you?

464
00:16:30,399 --> 00:16:31,019
A drink?

465
00:16:31,820 --> 00:16:32,559
Awesome!

466
00:16:32,940 --> 00:16:35,840
May your business reach the four seas,

467
00:16:36,159 --> 00:16:37,799
and wealth flow from the three rivers!

468
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:40,399
What're we having?

469
00:16:43,139 --> 00:16:43,960
You see,

470
00:16:44,120 --> 00:16:44,799
your bones are too soft.

471
00:16:45,419 --> 00:16:46,840
You need something hard to toughen up.

472
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:56,559
Wait...

473
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:01,580
Tian...

474
00:17:01,659 --> 00:17:02,700
Tian, you've gotta be kidding!

475
00:17:02,860 --> 00:17:03,799
How... how am I supposed to eat coal?

476
00:17:04,339 --> 00:17:05,720
I... I don't want the money anymore!

477
00:17:05,819 --> 00:17:06,400
Tian...

478
00:17:06,559 --> 00:17:07,880
Please have mercy on me!

479
00:17:08,039 --> 00:17:09,839
Just treat me like a fart and let me go!

480
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:11,039
I'm begging you!

481
00:17:11,460 --> 00:17:12,420
I'll... I'll shut up!

482
00:17:12,579 --> 00:17:13,220
I'll shut up!

483
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:13,980
Just treat me like a fart...

484
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:15,400
...and let me go!

485
00:17:19,019 --> 00:17:19,579
Tian!

486
00:17:19,599 --> 00:17:21,460
I was wrong, Tian!

487
00:17:23,519 --> 00:17:24,799
Tian!

488
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:28,819
Tian!

489
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:30,420
Tian!
